BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.8 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.4 Tf .094118 .133333 .188235 rg (Research on model belief often asks whether a system states consistent facts, updates after new evidence, or contains) Tj T* (a linearly decodable representation. These are important but different questions. Work on model belief editing has) Tj T* (explicitly cautioned that language models possess belief-like qualities only in a limited operational sense \() Tj .196078 .364706 .533333 rg (Hase et al.,) Tj T* (2021) Tj .094118 .133333 .188235 rg (\). Belief-revision benchmarks show that models can both fail to update when they should and update when they) Tj T* (should not \() Tj .196078 .364706 .533333 rg (Wilie et al., 2024) Tj .094118 .133333 .188235 rg (\). Longitudinal agent benchmarks now extend the problem to multi-session drift and) Tj T* (evidence-driven revision \() Tj .196078 .364706 .533333 rg (Myakala et al., 2026) Tj .094118 .133333 .188235 rg (\).) Tj T* ET
